  "title": "Marriage Seeking",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2015-11-13",
  "synopsis": "Personal ads and arranged marriages are popular for finding a suitable partner in China. Here we see the personal ad of a guy looking for a girl to marry.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/16/08e93638ebbe01cf087f6bca38dacad3a88a1508.mp3",
